'' RUN: '@type<integer>( 123 )' -- the address of a SCALAR type literal, as an argument and an
'' initialiser. fbc builds a temporary, 'TMP = 123ll; SHOW( &TMP )'; LowerAddr answered only a UDT
'' literal and the call declined (TKO0994; manual variadic_arguments/cva_3; fbc-examples repro ice13).
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/codegen/src/addr-of-scalar-type-literal.bas -o tests/codegen/addrofscalartypeliteral.exe
'' ENV: TIKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-FILE: tests/codegen/addrofscalartypeliteral.exe
'' RUN: tests/codegen/addrofscalartypeliteral.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: 123 5 2.5
